  "title": "India-Uzbekistan Strategic Partnership Deepens",
  "summary": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi and President Shavkat Mirziyoyev of Uzbekistan held delegation-level talks to strengthen trade, defense, and energy cooperation, with the two countries aiming to further their shared developmental vision of 'Viksit Bharat' and 'Yangi Uzbekistan'.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi held a two-day state visit to Uzbekistan from August 29 to 30 at the invitation of President Shavkat Mirziyoyev.",
